    "body": "Added to agenda to request [stage 1 (incubation)](https://whatwg.org/stages#stage1)\n* [X] A comprehensive explainer for the [Contribution](https://whatwg.org/ipr-policy#21-contribution), in a standards organization-approved incubation venue such as a [W3C CG](https://www.w3.org/community/groups/) or a branch of an existing WHATWG Standard.\n  * **[V2 additions explainer on OpenUI](https://open-ui.org/components/focusgroup-v2.explainer/)**\n* [ ]  Consensus that the WHATWG is interested in exploring solutions in this problem space.\n  * **This is what I would like to achive during the call.**\n* [X]  (At least) one implementer interested in doing prototyping work.\n  * **[Chromestatus entry](https://chromestatus.com/feature/5168133036965888), [Intent to Prototype in blink-dev]**(https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msgid/blink-dev/DS0PR00MB23683294D2AE6A8BBD1FC7B28BD32%40DS0PR00MB2368.namprd00.prod.outlook.com)\n* [X]  Identification of the [Contributor](https://whatwg.org/ipr-policy#contributor).\n* [X]  Identification of a relevant WHATWG Workstream and Standard that will host the [Contribution](https://whatwg.org/ipr-policy#21-contribution), and notification of the Workstream Editor(s).\n  * HTML, a follow-up spec PR will be created to keep V2 separate from the original effort.",
